{"id": 6397, "group": "campus-iit-patna-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-13T23:48:43.376319+00:00", "text": "Eternal OA | IIT Jodhpur\n\n16 MCQs - 20 mins\n\n* Mix of SQL, System Design, and CS Fundamentals.\n\n3 DSA Questions - 70 mins\n\n1. Song Playlist Randomisation\n    Given a list of songs and their artists, generate a randomized ordering. Prefer the artist with the maximum number of remaining songs. The same artist cannot be selected consecutively; if that happens, move to the next-best artist. Use song ordering as a tie-breaker.\n1. Equalising Two Arrays\n    Given two integer arrays, select and sum elements from either array such that both arrays end up with the same sum. Find the maximum possible length of the resulting arrays.\n1. Algorithm Training & Execution Scheduling\n    Given a list of algorithms, their possible execution dates, and the time required to train each algorithm, determine the minimum total time required to complete the training and execute the algorithms. this was in jodhpur and for ml roles the mcq changes the standard for dsa remains the same", "author_tag": "IITD", "reply_to": {"id": 6223, "text": "for ML Roles?", "author_tag": "IITB"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
